= Conclusion of the Guangxi Civil War

Ever since Chen Jiongming defeated Lu Rongting in the Second Yue-Gui war, Guangxi has fallen into anarchy. 

After a series of fights between the returning Lu Rongting, warlord Shen Hongying and warlord Li Zongren, the New Guangxi Clique has formed between Li Zongren, Bai Chongxi and Huang Shaohong.
The New Guangxi Clique has successfully taken over Nanning and have become the most powerful Clique in Guangxi.

This bodes well for us as Li Zongren is a Guomindang member. He has effectively become our ally in Guangxi.
